WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:15.692
♪♪

00:00:16.309 --> 00:00:18.098
DIRECTOR TYLER HAYWARD
We now have first person intel

00:00:18.098 --> 00:00:20.321
from inside the
Westview anomaly.

00:00:22.527 --> 00:00:23.488
JIMMY WOO
What are we looking at here?

00:00:23.488 --> 00:00:26.777
Is it an alternate reality?
Time travel?

00:00:27.978 --> 00:00:29.046
DARCY LEWIS
It's a sitcom.

00:00:29.046 --> 00:00:30.821
JIMMY WOO
Starring two Avengers?

00:00:31.994 --> 00:00:33.361
DARCY LEWIS
It's a working theory.

00:00:33.361 --> 00:00:35.536
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Well, I know the apron is a bit much,

00:00:35.536 --> 00:00:37.829
dear, but I am doing
my best to blend in!

00:00:38.886 --> 00:00:40.406
♪♪

00:00:40.431 --> 00:00:41.112
AGNES
Hello, dear!

00:00:41.112 --> 00:00:41.861
Hiya, kid!

00:00:41.861 --> 00:00:42.712
Hi, kiddo!

00:00:43.202 --> 00:00:45.629
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Life moves pretty fast out in the suburbs.

00:00:46.703 --> 00:00:47.726
VISION
I think something's wrong here.

00:00:47.726 --> 00:00:49.188
AGNES
[Laughing]

00:00:49.188 --> 00:00:50.908
Should we just
take it from the top?

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.141
JIMMY WOO
Wanda! Wanda!

00:00:53.688 --> 00:00:56.220
WANDA MAXIMOFF
I don't know how any of this started.

00:00:57.295 --> 00:00:59.142
VISION
What is outside of Westview?

00:01:00.736 --> 00:01:03.730
♪♪

00:01:08.506 --> 00:01:10.094
WANDA MAXIMOFF
Yeah, I'm not sure what that's about.

00:01:10.094 --> 00:01:13.552
It's probably just a
case of the Mondays. Am I right?

00:01:13.577 --> 00:01:18.709
♪♪

00:01:20.818 --> 00:01:22.140
WANDA MAXIMOFF
[Gasps]

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:23.477
Is this really happening?

00:01:23.477 --> 00:01:24.877
VISION
Yes, my love.

00:01:26.758 --> 00:01:28.063
JIMMY WOO
Are you crying?

00:01:28.711 --> 00:01:29.796
DARCY LEWIS
I'm invested!

